---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"watch\"])"
---
Live view: updates as devices, chargers and displays come and go

Usage: plugii watch [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --record <FILE>  Also record every snapshot to FILE as JSON lines (gzip-compressed when FILE ends in .gz), for `plugii replay`
      --redact         Replace device serial numbers and Thunderbolt unique IDs in the recording with REDACTED
      --force          Overwrite FILE if it exists
  -h, --help           Print help
